          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 17 2022 18:41:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>Traditional canister-based open waste management system versus closed system: hazardous exposure prevention and operating theatre staff satisfaction<br>\n</h2>\n<p><b>Authors:</b>&nbsp;M Horn, RN, CNS, N Patel, MBA, M MacLellan, MBA, N Millard, BBioMed (Hons), MMedSci</p>\n<p>Exposure to blood and body fluids is a major concern to health care professionals working in operating rooms (ORs). Thus, it is&nbsp;essential that hospitals use fluid waste management systems that minimise risk to staff, while maximising efficiency.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 22 2022 21:57:52 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
