          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c8b824f5b1@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 17 2022 18:41:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>Findings of a comparative analysis of operating room fluid waste removal at hospital for special surgery<br>\n</h2>\n<p><b>Author:</b>&nbsp;Rita Patel, MBA</p>\n<p>A&nbsp;study was done comparing the Neptune Waste Management System to fluid collection in suction canister, the method currently used at the Hopsital for Special Surgery.<br>\n</p>\n",
